  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Hey, how are you doing?",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.62,
   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_01"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Good, good. Thanks.",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "gap_before": 0.82,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_23"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I'm picking up a game I stopped playing six months ago and I have no idea what I was doing.",
   "est_sec": 6.3,
   "gap_before": 0.29,
   "block": "video_games.dlg13",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Classic. Does the game have a quest log or a journal? That's usually the quickest way to remember your goals.",
   "est_sec": 6.3,
   "gap_before": 0.97,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "video_games.dlg13"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "There's a journal, but I've forgotten all the controls too, Moshi.",
   "est_sec": 3.51,
   "gap_before": 1.3,
   "block": "video_games.dlg13",
   "kind": "moshi_name",
   "name_pos": "end",
   "addressee": "Moshi",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Check the settings menu, there's often a controls page. Or find a quiet area and just press every button to see what happens.",
   "est_sec": 7.23,
   "gap_before": 0.93,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "video_games.dlg13"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Hold on, can you say that again?",
   "est_sec": 2.27,
   "gap_before": 0.73,
   "block": "video_games.dlg13",
   "kind": "wait_like",
   "phrasing": "waitlike_02",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "No problem. Check the settings menu, there's often a controls page. Or find a quiet area and just press every button to see what happens.",
   "est_sec": 7.85,
   "gap_before": 0.82,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "video_games.dlg13"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "My inventory is also",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 1.33,
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause",
   "block": "video_games.dlg13"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "a total mess.",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "gap_before": 2.57,
   "block": "video_games.dlg13",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Then give yourself half an hour of tidying. Sell junk, check your gear, and read the item descriptions again. It helps everything come back.",
   "est_sec": 7.54,
   "gap_before": 0.69,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "video_games.dlg13"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Should I just restart?",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 1.13,
   "block": "video_games.dlg13",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Only if you weren't far in, or didn't enjoy your choices. Otherwise, muddle through for an hour and it usually clicks.",
